WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 5=

22
01:57.790 --> 01:58.349
Zi.

23
01:58.989 --> 02:00.189
We overlooked someone.

24
02:00.469 --> 02:01.030
Who is it?

25
02:01.710 --> 02:02.389
Ms. Hui.

26
02:04.510 --> 02:05.430
Tell me,

27
02:05.870 --> 02:06.870
could she be

28
02:06.950 --> 02:08.069
Di Liren's relative,

29
02:08.550 --> 02:09.469
or an acquaintance

30
02:09.469 --> 02:10.870
from his hometown?

31
02:11.949 --> 02:13.030
Why do you say that?

32
02:13.229 --> 02:14.150
The nurse told me

33
02:14.310 --> 02:15.550
Liren's phone was broken,

34
02:15.590 --> 02:16.789
yet he just took

35
02:16.789 --> 02:17.469
Ms. Hui's phone

36
02:17.509 --> 02:18.430
to make a video call.

37
02:18.550 --> 02:19.749
Who would he call?

38
02:20.310 --> 02:21.789
Zhang Tao? Chen Chen?

39
02:22.390 --> 02:23.229
Impossible.

40
02:23.430 --> 02:24.909
Ms. Hui doesn't have their WeChat.

41
02:26.229 --> 02:27.909
Then who could she contact?

42
02:28.870 --> 02:29.749
Only your parents.

43
02:30.189 --> 02:31.110
But their phones

44
02:31.150 --> 02:31.870
were with me,

45
02:31.949 --> 02:32.830
and they didn't ring.

46
02:33.469 --> 02:34.229
That proves it.

47
02:34.949 --> 02:36.390
It means Di Liren

48
02:36.830 --> 02:38.509
and Ms. Hui share a mutual friend,

49
02:38.669 --> 02:40.030
who matters

50
02:40.069 --> 02:41.110
a great deal to Di Liren.

51
02:41.629 --> 02:42.189
Listen.

52
02:42.629 --> 02:43.629
He couldn't even wait

53
02:43.629 --> 02:44.949
for the spare phone

54
02:45.069 --> 02:46.550
before making that video call.

55
02:47.469 --> 02:48.710
In that case,

56
02:48.789 --> 02:49.710
Lu Hui most likely

57
02:49.749 --> 02:50.629
knows something.

58
02:51.590 --> 02:53.189
Or she's helping Di Liren

59
02:53.349 --> 02:54.110
cover something up.

60
02:55.349 --> 02:56.390
Was she recommended

61
02:56.430 --> 02:57.349
by Di Liren back then?

62
02:57.949 --> 02:59.629
No, an agency recommended her.

63
03:00.110 --> 03:01.749
Ms. Hui used to be a nurse,

64
03:02.349 --> 03:02.749
good at

65
03:02.749 --> 03:04.083
caring for Parkinson's patients.

66
03:04.949 --> 03:05.469
My parents

67
03:05.550 --> 03:06.550
hired her

68
03:06.590 --> 03:07.669
once they saw her resume.

69
03:08.469 --> 03:09.229
Indeed.

70
03:09.469 --> 03:10.509
Over the past year,

71
03:10.909 --> 03:12.349
she took great care of them,

72
03:12.710 --> 03:14.189
and they trust her completely.

73
03:14.469 --> 03:15.509
Then finding an excuse

74
03:15.590 --> 03:16.710
to let her go

75
03:16.749 --> 03:18.229
won't be that easy.

76
03:19.909 --> 03:20.830
Wait.

77
03:21.229 --> 03:22.150
You told me

78
03:22.270 --> 03:23.509
Di Liren's parents died early.

79
03:23.590 --> 03:24.229
At his hometown,

80
03:24.310 --> 03:25.430
he might have no relatives.

81
03:25.710 --> 03:26.870
Maybe

82
03:27.189 --> 03:27.830
a distant one?

83
03:30.030 --> 03:30.789
If she isn't

84
03:30.789 --> 03:31.509
any acquaintance,

85
03:31.509 --> 03:32.229
I can't figure out

86
03:32.509 --> 03:33.349
why she would

87
03:33.430 --> 03:34.430
help Di Liren.

88
03:35.590 --> 03:36.189
Got paid off?

89
03:36.990 --> 03:37.590
No way.

90
03:37.870 --> 03:38.710
Ms. Hui doesn't look

91
03:39.229 --> 03:40.229
like that kind of person.

92
03:41.069 --> 03:42.789
What if she's not helping Di Liren,

93
03:43.590 --> 03:44.830
but that woman?

94
03:46.229 --> 03:47.270
You mean,

95
03:48.629 --> 03:49.430
Ms. Hui might

96
03:49.430 --> 03:50.310
know the mistress?

97
03:50.349 --> 03:51.629
That photo was mailed

98
03:51.669 --> 03:52.430
from your address.

99
03:52.949 --> 03:53.789
Maybe the mistress

100
03:53.830 --> 03:54.629
had Ms. Hui mail it

101
03:54.669 --> 03:55.830
to hide her identity.

102
03:56.110 --> 03:57.189
I bet Di Liren

103
03:57.270 --> 03:58.270
wouldn't let his mistress

104
03:58.270 --> 03:59.590
live in your complex.

105
03:59.870 --> 04:01.110
Liu Bai tailed Di Liren

106
04:01.310 --> 04:02.550
to your parents' place.

107
04:02.710 --> 04:03.909
We couldn't figure out why,

108
04:04.189 --> 04:05.509
but now it all makes sense.

109
04:06.229 --> 04:07.310
Lu Hui is the go-between

110
04:07.430 --> 04:08.949
for Di Liren and his mistress.

111
04:09.430 --> 04:10.310
His phone's broken.

112
04:10.669 --> 04:11.550
The mistress couldn't reach him.

113
04:11.550 --> 04:12.270
At that moment,

114
04:12.710 --> 04:13.629
Ms. Hui showed up.

115
04:13.710 --> 04:14.710
He used her phone

116
04:14.789 --> 04:16.229
to call the mistress.

117
04:30.748 --> 04:32.543
(Blood Pressure)

118
04:40.950 --> 04:41.549
How is it?

119
04:41.766 --> 04:43.466
(Blood Pressure)

120
04:44.150 --> 04:44.830
It's normal.

121
04:51.469 --> 04:52.510
Looking good. See?

122
04:54.869 --> 04:55.510
Not bad.

123
04:55.669 --> 04:56.270
Dad.

124
04:58.549 --> 04:59.229
Meng.

125
05:00.630 --> 05:01.270
Hui is

126
05:02.109 --> 05:03.309
so thoughtful.

127
05:03.830 --> 05:05.510
She checks my blood pressure frequently

128
05:05.830 --> 05:06.750
and logs every reading

129
05:06.789 --> 05:07.549
meticulously.

130
05:08.429 --> 05:09.109
At the hospital,

131
05:09.270 --> 05:10.150
she knows the answer

132
05:10.190 --> 05:11.469
to every doctor's question.

133
05:11.710 --> 05:13.030
Even the doctor praises her.

134
05:13.590 --> 05:14.549
Thank you, Ms. Hui.

135
05:15.150 --> 05:15.869
Don't mention it.

136
05:17.549 --> 05:18.349
Hui even installed

137
05:18.510 --> 05:19.429
an alarm for me

138
05:19.510 --> 05:20.229
in the bathroom.

139
05:20.390 --> 05:21.246
It rings once pulled.

140
05:22.070 --> 05:23.270
I used to work in a hospital.

141
05:23.549 --> 05:24.989
I often saw seniors slip and fall

142
05:24.989 --> 05:25.669
without anyone

143
05:25.669 --> 05:26.669
noticing immediately.

144
05:26.950 --> 05:28.510
So I try to be extra careful.

145
05:29.869 --> 05:30.469
Meng,

146
05:30.710 --> 05:32.190
is Liren coming for dinner tonight?

147
05:33.469 --> 05:34.789
He'd come straight from work.

148
05:35.789 --> 05:36.309
Great.

149
05:36.549 --> 05:36.950
Well,

150
05:37.070 --> 05:38.150
I'll let you two talk.

151
05:40.070 --> 05:40.549
Meng,

152
05:41.070 --> 05:41.710
you overpaid

153
05:41.750 --> 05:42.669
my salary last month.

154
05:43.989 --> 05:44.909
Not at all.

155
05:45.469 --> 05:45.989
Ms. Hui,

156
05:46.190 --> 05:47.669
you take such great care of them.

157
05:47.989 --> 05:49.109
That's a bonus.

158
05:49.229 --> 05:49.950
Just keep it.

159
05:50.109 --> 05:51.429
I only take my salary.

160
05:51.630 --> 05:52.270
Can't take it.

161
05:52.590 --> 05:53.270
I'll refund you.

162
05:53.950 --> 05:55.590
It's fine. Just keep it.

163
05:56.549 --> 05:57.229
Besides,

164
05:57.830 --> 05:59.270
that's from my own pocket.

165
05:59.630 --> 06:00.429
He won't know.

166
06:00.750 --> 06:01.349
Take it.

167
06:01.869 --> 06:02.830
Thank you,

168
06:03.750 --> 06:04.510
but

169
06:05.950 --> 06:07.030
I only take my salary.

170
06:07.950 --> 06:09.229
I can't accept any extra.

171
06:09.710 --> 06:10.669
Come on.

172
06:10.789 --> 06:12.030
Just take it.

173
06:12.549 --> 06:13.150
Well, Ms. Hui,

174
06:13.669 --> 06:14.909
I want to ask you something.

175
06:15.510 --> 06:17.390
Do you have any former colleagues

176
06:17.549 --> 06:18.750
who do caregiving?

177
06:19.229 --> 06:20.349
My friend is looking for

178
06:20.590 --> 06:21.429
a reliable caregiver

179
06:21.469 --> 06:22.510
like you.

180
06:23.909 --> 06:24.710
I'll ask around.

181
06:25.909 --> 06:26.989
Which hospital

182
06:27.510 --> 06:28.590
did you work at before?

183
06:29.229 --> 06:30.309
Xiaocheng First Hospital.

184
06:31.030 --> 06:31.950
Xiaocheng?

185
06:32.549 --> 06:33.789
I've been there.

186
06:34.109 --> 06:34.830
It's a nice place.

187
06:35.909 --> 06:37.030
Why did you come

188
06:37.150 --> 06:38.309
to work here?

189
06:39.630 --> 06:40.789
After my father passed away,

190
06:41.309 --> 06:42.109
I got divorced.

191
06:42.390 --> 06:43.750
There's nothing keeping me there.

192
06:45.710 --> 06:46.869
Divorced?

193
06:48.270 --> 06:49.669
What does your ex-husband do?

194
06:53.349 --> 06:54.030
Meng,

195
06:54.590 --> 06:55.789
what's wrong with you?

196
06:55.789 --> 06:56.590
Why keep bringing up

197
06:56.590 --> 06:58.070
Ms. Hui's painful memories?

198
06:58.750 --> 06:59.789
She lost touch with her ex

199
06:59.789 --> 07:00.869
a long time ago.

200
07:01.349 --> 07:02.390
She doesn't know

201
07:02.390 --> 07:03.309
what he does,

202
07:03.390 --> 07:04.270
or if he remarried.

203
07:04.750 --> 07:06.229
I just wanted to know more about her.

204
07:06.950 --> 07:07.510
But, Dad,

205
07:07.989 --> 07:09.309
how do you know so much?

206
07:10.669 --> 07:11.909
I only heard bits and pieces

207
07:11.909 --> 07:13.349
from Hui.

208
07:14.710 --> 07:15.590
Just the other day,

209
07:15.630 --> 07:17.190
her daughter

210
07:17.190 --> 07:18.469
called her up

211
07:18.789 --> 07:19.750
asking for money.

212
07:20.789 --> 07:22.469
She wants to study abroad

213
07:22.549 --> 07:23.789
and travel the world.

214
07:24.950 --> 07:25.510
Hui told her

215
07:25.510 --> 07:26.549
to ask her dad.

216
07:27.070 --> 07:27.549
But still,

217
07:28.150 --> 07:29.309
she gave her daughter

218
07:29.429 --> 07:30.270
money.

219
07:31.229 --> 07:32.669
Where did she get that money?

220
07:33.789 --> 07:34.510
Exactly.

221
07:35.309 --> 07:36.070
You kids don't get

222
07:36.469 --> 07:38.469
how tough life can be.

223
07:39.190 --> 07:40.429
Hui is having a tough life.

224
07:40.710 --> 07:41.630
We should try our best

225
07:41.789 --> 07:42.830
to help her.

226
07:44.869 --> 07:46.229
She really has it tough.

227
07:48.469 --> 07:49.630
Because of the divorce,

228
07:49.669 --> 07:51.469
her daughter

229
07:52.630 --> 07:53.630
resents her

230
07:53.710 --> 07:54.549
quite a bit.

231
07:55.590 --> 07:56.750
She never reaches out,

232
07:56.869 --> 07:57.590
only calls

233
07:57.630 --> 07:58.630
when she needs cash.

234
07:59.989 --> 08:01.229
Hui has been upset

235
08:01.630 --> 08:02.630
about it.

236
08:03.229 --> 08:03.869
One day,

237
08:04.190 --> 08:05.669
I even saw her

238
08:05.669 --> 08:07.390
crying alone in her room.

239
08:08.309 --> 08:09.109
Which day?

240
08:09.190 --> 08:09.710
It was...

241
08:17.390 --> 08:18.030
By the way, Mom,

242
08:18.429 --> 08:19.750
back then,

243
08:19.909 --> 08:20.830
the agency recommended

244
08:20.830 --> 08:21.669
a lot of candidates.

245
08:21.950 --> 08:22.630
How did we end up

246
08:22.630 --> 08:23.830
choosing Ms. Hui?

247
08:23.989 --> 08:25.190
Liu Zi wants

248
08:25.190 --> 08:25.909
to get a caregiver

249
08:25.909 --> 08:26.590
for her mom,

250
08:26.989 --> 08:28.160
and asks me how to pick one.

251
08:28.549 --> 08:30.270
Character comes first,

252
08:30.510 --> 08:32.390
then skills.

253
08:33.110 --> 08:34.589
Ms. Liu's caregiver

254
08:34.789 --> 08:36.069
has a gambler husband.

255
08:36.350 --> 08:37.789
He stole things from them

256
08:37.789 --> 08:39.030
and sold them.

257
08:39.069 --> 08:40.150
Horrible, right?

258
08:41.110 --> 08:41.750
Hui's background

259
08:41.829 --> 08:42.990
is very simple.

260
08:43.589 --> 08:44.669
Her parents are gone,

261
08:45.069 --> 08:46.309
and her kid lives with the ex.

262
08:47.309 --> 08:48.789
She doesn't need

263
08:48.789 --> 08:49.789
holidays off.

264
08:50.110 --> 08:50.630
How nice.

265
08:50.709 --> 08:51.270
Right.

266
08:52.630 --> 08:53.309
So you are

267
08:53.309 --> 08:54.429
an exploitative boss.

268
08:54.750 --> 08:56.309
Your husband said it.

269
08:56.350 --> 08:57.270
Go ask him.

270
08:58.390 --> 09:00.150
He was the one who picked Hui.

271
09:02.309 --> 09:02.949
So,

272
09:03.429 --> 09:04.870
it was Di Liren who picked Ms. Hui.

273
09:06.949 --> 09:07.390
Ms. Hui,

274
09:07.589 --> 09:08.030
two more.

275
09:08.030 --> 09:08.390
Okay.

276
09:10.030 --> 09:10.630
Honey,

277
09:11.669 --> 09:12.470
your delivery!

278
09:14.630 --> 09:15.462
I'll put them here.

279
09:15.829 --> 09:16.230
Okay.

280
09:19.429 --> 09:20.429
That was fast.

281
09:20.750 --> 09:21.949
It's the clothes I bought.

282
09:22.829 --> 09:23.270
Meng,

283
09:24.110 --> 09:25.069
why don't you

284
09:25.069 --> 09:26.270
ship your clothes

285
09:26.350 --> 09:27.270
to your own place?

286
09:27.510 --> 09:28.709
Because these

287
09:28.709 --> 09:29.949
are all clothes

288
09:29.949 --> 09:30.990
I bought for Ms. Hui.

289
09:32.429 --> 09:33.030
Ms. Hui,

290
09:33.549 --> 09:34.870
your clothes are all

291
09:35.110 --> 09:35.909
worn out.

292
09:35.909 --> 09:37.270
Just throw them away.

293
09:37.909 --> 09:38.829
Wear these instead.

294
09:40.110 --> 09:40.750
I picked these

295
09:41.709 --> 09:43.110
specifically for you.

296
09:43.309 --> 09:43.870
Take a look

297
09:43.870 --> 09:45.230
and see if the sizes

298
09:45.230 --> 09:45.870
fit.

299
09:46.829 --> 09:47.350
Meng,

300
09:47.750 --> 09:48.390
thank you.

301
09:48.909 --> 09:49.709
But I have nowhere

302
09:49.829 --> 09:50.789
to wear these clothes.

303
09:51.829 --> 09:52.429
Really.

304
09:53.270 --> 09:54.630
Of course, you do.

305
09:54.669 --> 09:56.110
You can wear them on your days off.

306
09:56.630 --> 09:57.230
Don't you ever

307
09:57.230 --> 09:58.309
go out on your days off?

308
09:58.909 --> 10:00.350
I don't.

309
10:00.470 --> 10:01.030
Thanks anyway.

310
10:01.949 --> 10:02.549
Well,

311
10:03.110 --> 10:04.589
don't you have any friends here?

312
10:07.110 --> 10:07.630
No.

313
10:10.189 --> 10:11.110
What about relatives?

314
10:14.350 --> 10:14.949
None either.

315
10:18.150 --> 10:18.470
Meng,

316
10:18.630 --> 10:19.630
please return them.

317
10:20.470 --> 10:21.390
I don't need them.

318
10:21.549 --> 10:22.030
Thank you.

319
10:30.110 --> 10:30.829
With the tags off,

320
10:30.829 --> 10:32.069
they can't be returned now.

321
10:32.549 --> 10:33.870
Just keep them, Ms. Hui.

322
10:34.030 --> 10:34.789
I spent a long time

323
10:34.789 --> 10:35.870
picking them out for you.

324
10:35.870 --> 10:36.669
I really...

325
10:37.150 --> 10:37.709
Ms. Hui,

326
10:38.709 --> 10:39.630
Meng just meant well.

327
10:40.230 --> 10:40.709
Take them.

328
10:43.270 --> 10:43.709
Well,

329
10:45.350 --> 10:46.230
thank you, Meng.

330
10:49.150 --> 10:49.909
Well, well.

331
10:50.990 --> 10:52.870
Ms. Hui refused to take them from me,

332
10:53.390 --> 10:54.429
but she accepted

333
10:54.709 --> 10:55.870
once my husband chimed in.

334
10:57.709 --> 10:58.949
It seems that in this house,

335
10:59.390 --> 11:00.909
Liren has the final word.

336
11:05.150 --> 11:05.750
Did Ms. Hui

337
11:05.750 --> 11:06.949
look upset just now?

338
11:07.510 --> 11:08.669
If you hadn't reminded me,

339
11:09.230 --> 11:10.230
I wouldn't have noticed.

340
11:11.789 --> 11:12.750
Why would she be?

341
11:13.030 --> 11:13.990
You just meant well.

342
11:16.789 --> 11:17.510
But Honey,

343
11:18.350 --> 11:19.909
her reaction felt

344
11:20.309 --> 11:21.270
a bit strange.

345
11:23.110 --> 11:24.909
Maybe she's having an off day.

346
11:25.230 --> 11:26.189
Everyone has sore spots.

347
11:27.030 --> 11:28.350
Her ex got custody of her kid.

348
11:28.789 --> 11:30.150
We should avoid asking about it.

349
11:32.750 --> 11:33.110
Right.

350
11:33.630 --> 11:34.589
Which country

351
11:34.789 --> 11:35.949
is her daughter studying in?

352
11:37.589 --> 11:38.309
No idea.

353
11:39.470 --> 11:40.390
Since she doesn't talk,

354
11:40.789 --> 11:41.909
it's probably too painful.

355
11:43.270 --> 11:44.549
Have you never met her daughter?

356
11:45.709 --> 11:47.230
Why would I have met her?

357
11:47.870 --> 11:48.309
Well,

358
11:48.870 --> 11:49.789
aren't you and Ms. Hui

359
11:50.230 --> 11:51.390
both from Xiaocheng?

360
11:51.990 --> 11:53.110
Didn't you two meet before?

361
11:54.470 --> 11:55.510
Xiaocheng is huge.

362
11:55.750 --> 11:56.789
How could I meet everyone?

363
12:01.709 --> 12:02.270
No.

364
12:04.990 --> 12:05.949
You must be hiding

365
12:05.949 --> 12:06.510
something.

366
12:07.829 --> 12:08.630
What's wrong?

367
12:11.189 --> 12:11.990
What is this?

368
12:13.949 --> 12:14.589
Honey,

369
12:14.589 --> 12:15.669
you must know some gossip

370
12:15.669 --> 12:16.669
and just don't tell me,

371
12:16.669 --> 12:17.510
right?

372
12:17.750 --> 12:18.870
Come on, tell me.

373
12:20.909 --> 12:22.230
I really don't.

374
12:23.189 --> 12:24.589
I don't chat with her.

375
12:25.069 --> 12:26.429
Dad knows way more than I do.

376
12:27.870 --> 12:28.429
You liar.

377
12:31.189 --> 12:31.990
Wait for me.

378
12:37.862 --> 12:39.070
(Calcium)

379
12:41.470 --> 12:42.309
Mom, Dad.

380
12:43.750 --> 12:44.589
Meng.

381
12:44.589 --> 12:45.429
You are back.

382
12:46.150 --> 12:47.069
What's all this?

383
12:47.150 --> 12:48.069
Why so much stuff?

384
12:48.350 --> 12:49.030
Hui bought

385
12:49.390 --> 12:50.309
calcium pills

386
12:50.309 --> 12:51.350
for your dad

387
12:51.470 --> 12:52.870
and herbal tonic gelatin for me.

388
12:53.350 --> 12:54.709
It must have cost a pretty penny.

389
12:56.390 --> 12:58.549
She said it was from your bonus.

390
12:59.030 --> 13:00.270
She had nothing to buy,

391
13:00.549 --> 13:01.909
so she got all these for us.

392
13:02.309 --> 13:03.390
Is that true?

393
13:04.150 --> 13:05.630
Ms. Hui takes great care of you,

394
13:06.150 --> 13:06.909
so she deserves

395
13:06.909 --> 13:07.949
that bonus.

396
13:12.309 --> 13:13.230
I thought

397
13:13.230 --> 13:14.350
it's the same calcium pills

398
13:14.429 --> 13:15.510
I got you, right?

399
13:15.870 --> 13:16.870
That's calcium carbonate.

400
13:17.429 --> 13:18.390
That would cause seniors

401
13:18.429 --> 13:19.870
discomfort and bloating.

402
13:20.230 --> 13:21.429
Mine's the calcium citrate.

403
13:22.110 --> 13:22.750
Easily absorbed.

404
13:22.870 --> 13:23.709
It suits seniors.

405
13:24.750 --> 13:25.789
I checked with a doctor.

406
13:25.949 --> 13:27.110
Your parents can take it.

407
13:29.949 --> 13:30.350
Lizhen,

408
13:30.909 --> 13:31.270
look.

409
13:31.630 --> 13:32.589
Meng is jealous.

410
13:33.510 --> 13:34.110
Meng,

411
13:34.589 --> 13:35.709
Hui

412
13:35.909 --> 13:36.909
was a nurse.

413
13:37.150 --> 13:38.110
She's professional.

414
13:43.589 --> 13:44.230
What's up, Dad?

415
13:44.350 --> 13:45.270
I'm fine.

416
13:45.589 --> 13:46.390
The doctor said

417
13:47.110 --> 13:48.510
it's nothing serious. No worries.

418
13:48.510 --> 13:49.189
Just sit.

419
13:51.350 --> 13:52.230
The doctor taught me

420
13:52.270 --> 13:53.069
these techniques.

421
13:53.630 --> 13:54.709
Whenever Mr. Yu feels off,

422
13:54.750 --> 13:55.350
massage

423
13:55.510 --> 13:56.150
can be helpful.

424
13:59.990 --> 14:00.829
Thank you, Ms. Hui.

425
14:00.949 --> 14:01.589
Really.

426
14:02.709 --> 14:03.150
Ms. Hui,

427
14:03.669 --> 14:04.429
how much

428
14:04.510 --> 14:05.309
are the supplements?

429
14:05.630 --> 14:06.408
I'll give you back.

430
14:06.549 --> 14:07.350
That bonus couldn't

431
14:07.470 --> 14:08.230
cover all this.

432
14:08.669 --> 14:09.030
No need.

433
14:09.549 --> 14:10.510
I have nothing to buy.

434
14:11.270 --> 14:12.230
You stay for dinner?

435
14:12.350 --> 14:12.949
I'll make more.

436
14:14.949 --> 14:15.870
No.

437
14:16.510 --> 14:16.909
I came

438
14:16.909 --> 14:17.990
to tell you

439
14:17.990 --> 14:19.150
I have a video shoot with Zi.

440
14:19.150 --> 14:20.350
I'll only be back tomorrow.

441
14:20.709 --> 14:22.270
Don't just vanish again.

442
14:22.549 --> 14:23.390
Take your phone.

443
14:23.870 --> 14:25.270
Don't worry, Mom.

444
14:25.309 --> 14:26.110
You can call Zi

445
14:26.110 --> 14:26.909
to reach me as well.

446
14:27.189 --> 14:27.589
Meng,

447
14:27.789 --> 14:28.949
have Liren drive you.

448
14:29.669 --> 14:30.990
No need, Dad. He's busy.

449
14:31.270 --> 14:32.110
I can go myself.

450
14:33.870 --> 14:34.589
We drove

451
14:34.630 --> 14:35.549
all the way out here.

452
14:35.630 --> 14:36.589
What are we shooting?

453
14:37.909 --> 14:38.589
Nothing.

454
14:39.270 --> 14:39.909
Nothing?

455
14:41.030 --> 14:42.309
I brought you here

456
14:42.390 --> 14:43.709
just to tell Di Liren

457
14:43.709 --> 14:44.230
and Lu Hui

458
14:44.510 --> 14:45.470
that I'd be away today.

459
14:45.709 --> 14:46.150
Why?

460
14:46.270 --> 14:47.549
You think they'll make a move?

461
14:48.750 --> 14:49.990
I deliberately asked Lu Hui

462
14:49.990 --> 14:50.669
many questions.

463
14:51.230 --> 14:52.390
And they seemed rattled.

464
14:52.870 --> 14:53.709
Now,

465
14:53.909 --> 14:55.150
they won't stay idle.

466
14:55.829 --> 14:57.309
Sounds like you have a plan.

467
15:00.110 --> 15:01.189
Thinking back carefully,

468
15:01.870 --> 15:03.390
whenever Di Liren is home,

469
15:03.669 --> 15:04.750
he never chats

470
15:04.789 --> 15:05.709
with Lu Hui,

471
15:06.470 --> 15:07.390
except in two places.

472
15:08.189 --> 15:08.789
Where?

473
15:09.350 --> 15:10.150
The terrace,

474
15:10.309 --> 15:11.309
and the courtyard.

475
15:12.789 --> 15:13.230
Lizhen,

476
15:14.949 --> 15:16.429
the air feels so good out here.

477
15:16.909 --> 15:17.309
Here.

478
15:19.069 --> 15:19.589
Refreshing.

479
15:27.309 --> 15:28.309
Have some fruit.

480
15:29.669 --> 15:30.150
Hui,

481
15:30.750 --> 15:32.589
what year is your daughter in college?

482
15:34.030 --> 15:34.630
Graduate soon.

483
15:35.069 --> 15:36.150
Does she have a boyfriend?

484
15:39.589 --> 15:39.990
No.

485
15:41.669 --> 15:42.069
Good.

486
15:42.909 --> 15:43.990
A young girl

487
15:45.110 --> 15:46.589
should focus on her studies.

488
15:47.230 --> 15:47.870
So,

489
15:47.909 --> 15:48.630
is she planning

490
15:48.630 --> 15:49.789
to go to graduate school?

491
15:50.669 --> 15:51.669
She hasn't told me,

492
15:51.669 --> 15:52.990
so I'm not sure.

493
15:53.990 --> 15:54.789
That won't do.

494
15:56.110 --> 15:56.750
I think

495
15:56.909 --> 15:57.870
a parent should step in

496
15:58.110 --> 15:59.270
when needed.

497
15:59.709 --> 16:01.870
She's still young and ignorant.

498
16:01.990 --> 16:03.150
She studies abroad.

499
16:03.150 --> 16:04.150
She's seen the world.

500
16:04.390 --> 16:05.390
She knows plenty.

501
16:07.350 --> 16:08.309
I mean,

502
16:08.429 --> 16:09.630
like with our Meng.

503
16:09.789 --> 16:10.150
Remember?

504
16:10.350 --> 16:11.429
When she finished college,

505
16:11.589 --> 16:13.069
we wanted her to go to grad school.

506
16:13.189 --> 16:14.789
We even picked the school for her,

507
16:14.909 --> 16:15.309
and yet

508
16:15.549 --> 16:17.069
she refused to go.

509
16:31.949 --> 16:32.589
It's pitch dark.

510
16:33.069 --> 16:34.030
Why still out here?

511
16:34.589 --> 16:35.870
Just catching my breath, Mr. Di.

512
16:38.470 --> 16:38.909
I'll help.

513
16:39.669 --> 16:40.069
No need.

514
16:52.829 --> 16:54.150
You handled the money

515
16:54.630 --> 16:55.829
Yu Meng gave you well.

516
16:56.669 --> 16:57.589
What else could I do?

517
16:58.669 --> 16:59.350
Yu Meng has been

518
16:59.350 --> 17:00.270
asking about you.

519
17:01.069 --> 17:01.750
I'm worried.

520
17:02.829 --> 17:03.949
I have an idea.

521
17:04.430 --> 17:05.589
You set things up these days.

522
17:07.149 --> 17:08.470
Just say your child is sick,

523
17:08.789 --> 17:09.710
and in two weeks,

524
17:10.109 --> 17:11.389
you have to go abroad with her

525
17:11.549 --> 17:12.109
for surgery.

526
17:15.869 --> 17:16.470
Why?

527
17:16.990 --> 17:17.710
Yu Meng might be

528
17:17.710 --> 17:18.829
suspicious of you.

529
17:19.470 --> 17:20.829
You're working here.

530
17:21.430 --> 17:22.109
If things go off,

531
17:22.309 --> 17:23.589
it's three against one.

532
17:23.789 --> 17:24.670
You might get hurt.

533
17:25.910 --> 17:26.789
You are here, right?

534
17:28.470 --> 17:29.470
What if I'm not around?

535
17:29.710 --> 17:30.309
I won't leave

536
17:31.389 --> 17:32.030
until you do.

537
17:33.789 --> 17:34.190
Lu Hui.

538
17:52.149 --> 17:53.670
I felt the calluses on your hands,

539
17:54.710 --> 17:55.589
and I never forgot.

540
17:58.470 --> 17:59.309
I asked

541
17:59.309 --> 18:00.309
our R&amp;D team,

542
18:00.869 --> 18:02.430
and they told me almond oil

543
18:02.869 --> 18:03.589
and fruit acids

544
18:04.069 --> 18:04.825
in this hand cream

545
18:05.789 --> 18:06.750
can soften calluses.

546
18:08.670 --> 18:09.750
So I bought some.

547
18:10.389 --> 18:11.190
In your room now.

548
18:11.990 --> 18:12.510
Use them.

549
18:15.789 --> 18:16.629
I'm just a caregiver.

550
18:18.030 --> 18:19.789
Calluses are only natural.

551
18:23.510 --> 18:24.230
To me,

552
18:25.190 --> 18:26.629
you're still the same as before.

553
18:28.030 --> 18:28.789
Like what?

554
18:29.829 --> 18:30.589
The one I want

555
18:30.589 --> 18:31.470
to take care.

556
18:32.002 --> 18:36.149
(Xiaocheng, 21 Years Ago)

557
18:36.149 --> 18:37.283
(Young Di Liren) The funeral is starting soon.

558
18:38.076 --> 18:39.696
(Young Lu Hui)

559
18:43.149 --> 18:44.230
In a few days,

560
18:44.789 --> 18:46.030
the factory will shut down.

561
18:49.149 --> 18:49.789
With Dad gone,

562
18:54.149 --> 18:54.750
I have nowhere

563
18:54.789 --> 18:55.869
left to go.

564
19:04.270 --> 19:04.910
Stay with me.

565
19:06.589 --> 19:07.270
From now on,

566
19:08.190 --> 19:09.110
I'll take care of you.

567
19:11.190 --> 19:11.710
No.

568
19:15.430 --> 19:16.750
I can't become a burden to you.

569
19:23.149 --> 19:24.230
Have you ever considered

570
19:25.589 --> 19:26.349
what will happen

571
19:26.349 --> 19:27.549
if they know about us?

572
19:29.750 --> 19:30.950
If something happens to you,

573
19:32.069 --> 19:33.389
what I've done will be in vain.

574
19:42.950 --> 19:43.950
We have no relationship,

575
19:46.109 --> 19:47.149
and we shouldn't have one.

576
19:48.230 --> 19:48.910
I know

577
19:49.910 --> 19:50.629
you're worried

578
19:50.670 --> 19:51.829
that I love that woman,

579
19:52.230 --> 19:52.670
right?

580
19:53.309 --> 19:54.030
I swear to you,

581
19:54.869 --> 19:56.309
it's all just an act.

582
19:56.750 --> 19:57.789
Once I take care

583
19:57.829 --> 19:58.549
of everything,

584
19:59.030 --> 19:59.789
we'll leave here.

585
20:00.470 --> 20:01.389
I'll make up

586
20:01.389 --> 20:02.670
for all the years we missed.

587
20:03.149 --> 20:04.069
Just give me some time,

588
20:04.869 --> 20:05.309
okay?

589
20:32.789 --> 20:34.309
Turns out my life

590
20:34.710 --> 20:36.510
is just like making videos.

591
20:37.230 --> 20:39.470
Partly real, mostly fake.

592
20:40.470 --> 20:41.190
No one knows

593
20:41.190 --> 20:42.430
that a marriage looking perfect

594
20:42.789 --> 20:44.430
from the outside

595
20:44.950 --> 20:46.069
could be completely

596
20:46.069 --> 20:47.549
(Good morning, Honey) rotten to the core.

597
20:48.389 --> 20:49.470
And inside me,

598
20:50.389 --> 20:51.910
(I'm heading to work) countless insects are eating away

599
20:51.910 --> 20:52.670
(Left you breakfast in the kitchen) at my flesh.

600
20:52.950 --> 20:54.069
(Wait for me to get back) I can clearly hear

601
20:54.069 --> 20:55.670
the sound of their gnawing teeth.

602
20:55.670 --> 20:58.190
(When you're free, let's talk about our upcoming plans)

603
20:58.190 --> 20:59.470
I'm such a fool.

604
21:04.003 --> 21:05.623
(Ms. Hui)

605
21:11.190 --> 21:11.549
Meng,

606
21:12.030 --> 21:12.750
Mr. Yu passed out.

607
21:12.750 --> 21:13.270
Come over

608
21:13.470 --> 21:14.230
to the hospital.

609
21:14.910 --> 21:15.389
What?

610
21:19.750 --> 21:20.230
Doctor,

611
21:20.670 --> 21:21.470
how is my dad?

612
21:21.910 --> 21:22.510
He suffered

613
21:22.549 --> 21:23.670
a brain hemorrhage

614
21:23.670 --> 21:24.990
from Parkinson's complications.

615
21:25.230 --> 21:26.190
The bleeding is minor,

616
21:26.270 --> 21:27.663
so conservative treatment is fine.

617
21:27.990 --> 21:29.510
He's stable for now,

618
21:29.510 --> 21:30.950
but still needs to stay overnight.

619
21:32.030 --> 21:32.549
What else

620
21:32.549 --> 21:33.270
needs attention?

621
21:34.149 --> 21:35.270
The nurse will tell you.

622
21:36.349 --> 21:37.549
The golden window for rescue

623
21:37.549 --> 21:38.549
is one to three hours.

624
21:38.910 --> 21:40.030
Luckily, you acted fast.

625
21:40.389 --> 21:40.789
Well,

626
21:40.789 --> 21:41.869
the first aid

627
21:42.230 --> 21:42.829
was done well.

628
21:43.990 --> 21:44.710
Our caregiver

629
21:44.710 --> 21:45.789
used to be a nurse.

630
21:45.990 --> 21:46.470
No wonder.

631
21:46.990 --> 21:47.670
Family members

632
21:47.789 --> 21:48.829
should learn

633
21:48.829 --> 21:49.589
basic first aid.

634
21:49.710 --> 21:50.869
Don't panic in an emergency.

635
21:51.230 --> 21:52.109
Thank you, Doctor.

636
21:57.710 --> 21:58.069
Dad.

637
22:29.950 --> 22:30.309
Ms. Hui,

638
22:32.030 --> 22:32.510
thank you.

639
22:34.389 --> 22:35.629
My dad had a hemorrhage too.

640
22:37.030 --> 22:37.789
I know what to do.

641
22:44.470 --> 22:44.990
What's wrong?

642
22:48.910 --> 22:49.389
Nothing.

643
22:51.470 --> 22:53.069
Everything just happened so fast,

644
22:54.149 --> 22:55.030
I still need time

645
22:55.349 --> 22:56.389
to figure them out.

646
23:30.950 --> 23:31.950
Thank you, Mr. Dong,

647
23:32.389 --> 23:33.910
for coming all the way to see my dad.

648
23:34.470 --> 23:35.149
Your father and I

649
23:35.149 --> 23:36.230
go back decades.

650
23:36.349 --> 23:37.069
He had a surgery.

651
23:37.109 --> 23:38.190
Of course, I should come.

652
23:38.629 --> 23:40.103
But I didn't expect it's so serious.

653
23:40.710 --> 23:41.470
How is he now?

654
23:43.109 --> 23:44.309
Luckily, he got here in time.

655
23:44.510 --> 23:45.910
Two days of observation,

656
23:45.910 --> 23:46.629
and he can go.

657
23:48.349 --> 23:48.950
Good then.

658
23:50.190 --> 23:51.470
Actually, I also came

659
23:51.829 --> 23:52.750
for another matter.

660
23:53.869 --> 23:55.430
The company is launching

661
23:55.430 --> 23:56.190
the Jinghua line,

662
23:56.190 --> 23:56.990
you know it, right?

663
23:58.549 --> 23:59.990
What's wrong, Mr. Dong?

664
24:01.270 --> 24:02.230
I wanted

665
24:02.309 --> 24:03.270
to use this launch

666
24:03.389 --> 24:04.190
as an opportunity

667
24:04.230 --> 24:05.030
to audit our books

668
24:05.190 --> 24:06.270
from these years,

669
24:07.510 --> 24:08.389
but Mr. Di

670
24:08.430 --> 24:09.869
keeps insisting it isn't necessary.

671
24:12.270 --> 24:13.109
I was thinking...

672
24:13.230 --> 24:14.670
I agree with

673
24:14.950 --> 24:15.950
whatever Liren does.

674
24:16.430 --> 24:16.910
Meng,

675
24:17.349 --> 24:18.710
you're being too naive about this.

676
24:18.710 --> 24:19.190
Mr. Dong.

677
24:20.069 --> 24:21.030
Relax. I trust him.

678
24:22.069 --> 24:22.510
Honey.

679
24:23.629 --> 24:24.030
Honey.

680
24:25.270 --> 24:25.910
- Liren. - Mr. Dong.

681
24:28.549 --> 24:29.069
Chatting?

682
24:30.069 --> 24:31.270
I was about to see him out.

683
24:32.389 --> 24:32.829
You chat.

684
24:33.069 --> 24:33.789
I'll go check.

685
24:34.670 --> 24:35.670
Nursing massages.

686
24:35.829 --> 24:37.309
Rubbing his hands, feet,

687
24:37.430 --> 24:38.470
and joints

688
24:38.629 --> 24:39.710
improves blood circulation.

689
24:41.270 --> 24:41.750
Done now.

690
24:42.270 --> 24:42.629
Thanks.

691
24:42.750 --> 24:43.109
Nothing.

692
24:45.750 --> 24:46.470
Let me do it.

693
24:46.990 --> 24:47.750
I can do it myself.

694
24:48.309 --> 24:49.389
I can take care of him.

695
24:59.910 --> 25:01.149
There are many acupoints.

696
25:01.190 --> 25:01.750
Can't mess with it.

697
25:02.510 --> 25:03.149
I know.

698
25:07.430 --> 25:07.789
Mom,

699
25:08.589 --> 25:09.670
why not let Ms. Hui do it?

700
25:10.109 --> 25:10.869
Dad is groaning.

701
25:12.389 --> 25:13.270
Just trust me.

702
25:13.549 --> 25:14.589
