1045
36:40.629 --> 36:41.790
I'm not the party involved.

1046
36:42.149 --> 36:42.950
I don't want to mislead you.

1047
36:42.950 --> 36:43.790
My friend

1048
36:43.790 --> 36:44.430
lives abroad.

1049
36:44.830 --> 36:45.310
Of course,

1050
36:46.430 --> 36:47.109
he registered

1051
36:47.149 --> 36:47.950
his marriage here.

1052
36:48.310 --> 36:48.790
Don't worry.

1053
36:49.430 --> 36:50.910
He wants to talk to you in person.

1054
36:51.470 --> 36:51.990
I wonder

1055
36:52.510 --> 36:53.310
if you accept.

1056
36:54.830 --> 36:56.269
Abroad is too far.

1057
36:56.629 --> 36:58.030
I have plenty of cases on my plate.

1058
37:00.109 --> 37:01.669
A high-profile lawyer like you

1059
37:02.269 --> 37:03.549
must have assistants.

1060
37:04.510 --> 37:05.229
Take this case

1061
37:05.990 --> 37:07.990
as a paid vacation.

1062
37:08.950 --> 37:10.044
Flights and hotels covered.

1063
37:10.430 --> 37:12.350
Retainer fees won't be an issue.

1064
37:15.709 --> 37:16.350
How much?

1065
37:18.030 --> 37:18.629
Your call.

1066
37:19.629 --> 37:20.510
My friend just

1067
37:20.749 --> 37:21.709
wants the issue solved.

1068
37:22.069 --> 37:22.629
You can

1069
37:22.990 --> 37:23.629
name any price.

1070
37:26.629 --> 37:28.350
That's a hard offer to reject.

1071
37:29.589 --> 37:30.470
But I reject.

1072
37:33.030 --> 37:34.430
May I ask why?

1073
37:35.709 --> 37:37.510
I take cases based on my mood,

1074
37:38.189 --> 37:38.830
not money.

1075
37:41.109 --> 37:41.669
Alright then.

1076
37:42.790 --> 37:43.549
I'll take my leave.

1077
37:47.030 --> 37:47.790
Mr. Jiao,

1078
37:47.830 --> 37:48.990
you don't play by the rules.

1079
37:50.870 --> 37:51.910
I've never seen

1080
37:51.950 --> 37:53.149
a claw machine

1081
37:53.549 --> 37:54.510
in a law office.

1082
37:59.390 --> 38:00.830
Lawyers have to deal with

1083
38:00.830 --> 38:02.109
dirty human

1084
38:02.990 --> 38:03.629
nature.

1085
38:05.269 --> 38:06.310
A claw machine

1086
38:06.549 --> 38:07.430
helps me calm my mind.

1087
38:08.229 --> 38:09.669
Then you need more experiences.

1088
38:10.749 --> 38:11.629
For a lawyer,

1089
38:12.390 --> 38:14.189
being shortsighted is a fatal flaw.

1090
38:27.109 --> 38:27.510
He left.

1091
38:31.990 --> 38:32.870
Oh, no!

1092
38:35.749 --> 38:36.749
Di Liren must know

1093
38:36.790 --> 38:37.830
you're my lawyer.

1094
38:38.510 --> 38:39.350
He's on guard now.

1095
38:39.629 --> 38:40.870
Then catching him red-handed

1096
38:41.030 --> 38:41.669
will be harder.

1097
38:43.149 --> 38:44.350
I have to find a way

1098
38:44.510 --> 38:45.709
to distract him.

1099
38:46.189 --> 38:47.830
Then he should be the one sweating,

1100
38:48.629 --> 38:49.870
because I'm your lawyer.

1101
38:54.269 --> 38:54.830
Play a round.

1102
38:58.910 --> 38:59.629
Which one?

1103
39:01.069 --> 39:01.510
That one.

1104
39:01.950 --> 39:03.549
The smug one that looks just like you.

1105
39:05.589 --> 39:06.390
I'm not smug,

1106
39:06.910 --> 39:07.910
but confident.

1107
39:14.589 --> 39:16.030
So close!

1108
39:16.709 --> 39:17.510
Give me more coins.

1109
39:18.669 --> 39:19.589
Ten yuan for three.

1110
39:19.870 --> 39:21.390
WeChat Pay or Alipay?

1111
39:24.549 --> 39:25.950
You're not just smug,

1112
39:26.189 --> 39:27.589
but also a rip-off artist.

1113
39:28.229 --> 39:28.870
Done playing.

1114
39:31.549 --> 39:32.390
Stingy.

1115
39:34.430 --> 39:35.549
Use your connections

1116
39:35.709 --> 39:36.390
to dig up more

1117
39:36.390 --> 39:37.350
about Lu Hui's past.

1118
39:40.269 --> 39:41.149
I'll think of a way.

1119
39:42.910 --> 39:43.741
Where are you going?

1120
39:44.310 --> 39:45.470
I have to meet a client.

1121
39:45.510 --> 39:46.149
Give you a ride.

1122
39:47.709 --> 39:48.269
No need.

1123
39:48.589 --> 39:49.651
I'll go to the hospital.

1124
39:50.069 --> 39:51.229
People from the company came.

1125
39:51.629 --> 39:53.629
There's probably a major decision

1126
39:53.629 --> 39:54.790
waiting for Dad's signature.

1127
39:55.390 --> 39:56.669
Since he stepped down,

1128
39:56.790 --> 39:58.109
he only trusts Di Liren.

1129
39:58.390 --> 39:59.189
I need to be there,

1130
39:59.709 --> 40:00.669
so the signing

1131
40:00.910 --> 40:02.030
doesn't become a formality.

1132
40:02.350 --> 40:03.709
Aside from Dong Jun,

1133
40:04.189 --> 40:05.430
who else is close to you?

1134
40:05.910 --> 40:07.950
I know all the executives,

1135
40:08.430 --> 40:09.430
but not very well.

1136
40:10.030 --> 40:11.589
Probably just Mr. Tian.

1137
40:13.069 --> 40:14.109
Mr. Tian and Dad

1138
40:14.229 --> 40:15.470
have been friends for decades.

1139
40:15.749 --> 40:17.229
They co-founded Jiali,

1140
40:17.629 --> 40:19.030
and hold the majority shares.

1141
40:20.390 --> 40:21.310
Later, Mr. Dong

1142
40:21.310 --> 40:22.549
joined them

1143
40:22.549 --> 40:23.381
as a core executive.

1144
40:23.669 --> 40:24.749
With Dad and Mr. Tian,

1145
40:24.910 --> 40:25.910
they formed a tight trio.

1146
40:26.549 --> 40:28.189
Even though Mr. Tian and I

1147
40:28.189 --> 40:29.189
barely see each other,

1148
40:29.709 --> 40:31.269
we're still quite close.

1149
40:31.709 --> 40:33.149
After all, he watched me grow up.

1150
40:37.589 --> 40:38.189
Mr. Tian.

1151
40:42.069 --> 40:42.549
Liren.

1152
40:42.950 --> 40:43.549
Mr. Tian.

1153
40:43.870 --> 40:44.269
Why

1154
40:44.269 --> 40:45.910
do you look much thinner?

1155
40:48.765 --> 40:51.471
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1156
40:51.870 --> 40:52.430
Would

1157
40:52.430 --> 40:53.910
I lose Jiali?

1158
40:54.269 --> 40:55.310
No way.

1159
40:55.790 --> 40:57.430
Your dad is Jiali's biggest shareholder.

1160
40:57.669 --> 40:58.830
The shares he holds

1161
40:59.030 --> 41:00.069
are more than Mr. Tian's.

1162
41:00.229 --> 41:00.950
Did you know Di Liren

1163
41:00.950 --> 41:01.589
(Chairman: Di Liren) changed his name?

1164
41:02.430 --> 41:03.310
Formerly Fang Yong,

1165
41:03.549 --> 41:04.189
as in Bravery.

1166
41:04.870 --> 41:05.629
What did you find?

1167
41:06.310 --> 41:07.669
Di Liren, formerly Fang Yong,

1168
41:07.910 --> 41:09.549
was once Lu Hui's husband.

1169
41:10.749 --> 41:11.430
(Without me,) I sent you the proof.

1170
41:11.430 --> 41:11.868
(Mom and Dad would be happier)

1171
41:12.589 --> 41:14.030
So from the very beginning,

1172
41:14.709 --> 41:15.510
he was lying to me.

1173
41:15.830 --> 41:16.990
I lent you out.

1174
41:17.549 --> 41:18.749
We are the real family.

1175
41:19.830 --> 41:20.470
Four years.

1176
41:23.229 --> 41:23.990
It's a deal.

1177
41:35.716 --> 41:39.148
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1178
41:39.425 --> 41:42.280
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1179
41:42.649 --> 41:45.477
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1180
41:45.477 --> 41:49.292
♪Still seeking open fields in the ruins♪

1181
41:49.292 --> 41:50.933
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

1182
41:50.933 --> 41:52.638
♪Repeating the same fate♪

1183
41:52.638 --> 41:54.066
♪I hear high heels♪

1184
41:54.066 --> 41:55.835
♪Crushing silent replies♪

1185
41:55.835 --> 41:57.476
♪Every step feels like a trial♪

1186
41:57.476 --> 41:58.968
♪Yet sobers me up♪

1187
41:58.968 --> 42:00.865
♪Love is a thorny rose♪

1188
42:00.865 --> 42:02.399
♪Promises are mere anesthesia♪

1189
42:02.399 --> 42:04.147
♪I once gave it my all♪

1190
42:04.147 --> 42:06.023
♪Only to be shattered in pieces♪

1191
42:06.214 --> 42:07.834
♪Now I forge my tears♪

1192
42:07.834 --> 42:09.475
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

1193
42:09.475 --> 42:11.287
♪No longer asking who's right or wrong♪

1194
42:11.287 --> 42:15.571
♪Only who dares to control me♪

1195
42:16.508 --> 42:18.213
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

1196
42:18.213 --> 42:19.769
♪Nor am I anyone's failure♪

1197
42:19.769 --> 42:21.218
♪Even with broken wings♪

1198
